d":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.97"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":-3.84,"default_fair_val":-3.84,"premium_pct":-396.1,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":2.2,"pb_forward":2,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":6.6,"fcf_to_ev":2.32,"fcf_to_mcap":3.8,"liab_to_assets":68.2,"cash_to_assets":0,"current_ratio":0.97,"roe":-57.7,"roa":-18.3,"moat":{"ticker":"WULF","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"TeraWulf 作為一家比特幣挖礦公司，其品牌價值與定價權幾乎不存在。其產品（比特幣）的價格由全球市場供需決定，公司無法獨立定價。品牌忠誠度在加密貨幣挖礦領域微乎其微，客戶（礦工）更關注算力成本與效率。與傳統消費品或服務公司不同，WULF 的品牌無法築起顯著的護城河，其競爭優勢更多來自於營運效率和成本控制，而非品牌溢價。","comment_en":"TeraWulf, as a Bitcoin mining company, possesses virtually no brand value or pricing power. The price of its product (Bitcoin) is determined by global market supply and demand, and the company cannot independently set prices. Brand loyalty in the cryptocurrency mining sector is minimal; customers (miners) are primarily concerned with hash rate costs and efficiency. Unlike traditional consumer goods or service companies, WULF's brand cannot establish a significant moat. Its competitive advantages stem more from operational efficiency and cost control rather than brand premium."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"比特幣挖礦行業的技術門檻主要在於硬體效率和能源成本，而非專利保護。WULF 並不依賴專利或特許經營權來建立競爭壁壘。其營運模式是公開的，技術相對標準化，沒有顯著的監管保護或獨家許可。任何公司都可以進入這個市場，只要能獲得足夠的電力供應和硬體設備。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，WULF 的護城河極為薄弱。","comment_en":"The technological barrier in the Bitcoin mining industry lies primarily in hardware efficiency and energy costs, not patent protection. WULF does not rely on patents or exclusive licenses to establish competitive barriers. Its operational model is public, and the technology is relatively standardized, lacking significant regulatory protection or exclusive permits. Any company can enter this market as long as it can secure sufficient power supply and hardware. Therefore, WULF's moat in terms of patents and regulatory barriers is extremely weak."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"對於比特幣挖礦公司而言，客戶轉換成本極低。礦工若要更換挖礦服務提供商，只需將其算力轉移到新的礦池，幾乎沒有額外的時間、金錢或技術投入。WULF 的客戶群體主要是其自身營運的礦機，而非外部客戶。即使考慮到礦工選擇礦池的決策，轉換成本也微乎其微。這意味著 WULF 無法透過提高客戶轉換成本來鞏固其市場地位。","comment_en":"For Bitcoin mining companies, customer switching costs are extremely low. If miners wish to switch mining service providers, they simply need to redirect their hash power to a new mining pool with minimal additional time, financial, or technical investment. WULF's customer base primarily consists of its own operated mining rigs, not external clients. Even considering miners' decisions in choosing mining pools, the switching costs are negligible. This implies that WULF cannot solidify its market position by increasing customer switching costs."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"比特幣挖礦行業幾乎不存在網絡效應。雖然比特幣網絡本身具有網絡效應，但單一挖礦公司 WULF 並不能從中受益。挖礦公司的成功取決於其獨立的營運效率、能源成本和算力規模，而非與其他參與者的連接或協作。WULF 的業務模式不依賴於用戶群的增長來提升價值，因此網絡效應並非其護城河的一部分。","comment_en":"Network effects are virtually non-existent in the Bitcoin mining industry. While the Bitcoin network itself possesses network effects, a single mining company like WULF cannot directly benefit from them. The success of a mining company depends on its independent operational efficiency, energy costs, and hash rate scale, not on connections or collaborations with other participants. WULF's business model does not rely on user base growth to enhance its value, thus network effects are not part of its moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"WULF 的主要競爭優勢來自於規模經濟和成本控制，特別是能源成本。公司透過建立大型、高效能的數據中心，並尋求低廉的電力來源（如與核電廠合作），來降低單位算力的挖礦成本。這種規模優勢使其能夠在比特幣價格波動時保持一定的盈利能力，並在競爭激烈的市場中生存。然而，能源價格的波動和硬體升級的持續投入，限制了其成本優勢的絕對性。","comment_en":"WULF's primary competitive advantage stems from economies of scale and cost control, particularly in energy expenses. By establishing large, high-performance data centers and seeking low-cost power sources (such as partnerships with nuclear power plants), the company reduces its cost per unit of hash rate. This scale advantage allows it to maintain a degree of profitability amidst Bitcoin price volatility and survive in a highly competitive market. However, fluctuations in energy prices and continuous investment in hardware upgrades limit the absolute nature of its cost advantage."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"WULF 的部分營運據點位於能源成本較低的地區，這構成了一定的地理優勢。例如，其與核電廠的合作關係，確保了相對穩定且廉價的電力供應。然而，這種地理資產並非絕對獨特，其他競爭對手也在積極尋求類似的低成本能源解決方案。此外，比特幣挖礦的地理位置彈性較高，只要有足夠電力和網路連接，即可進行挖礦，因此這種優勢的持久性和獨特性有限。","comment_en":"Some of WULF's operational sites are located in regions with lower energy costs, which provides a certain geographical advantage. For instance, its partnerships with nuclear power plants ensure a relatively stable and inexpensive power supply. However, this geographical asset is not absolutely unique, as other competitors are also actively seeking similar low-cost energy solutions. Furthermore, the geographical flexibility of Bitcoin mining is high; mining can occur anywhere with sufficient power and internet connectivity, thus the durability and uniqueness of this advantage are limited."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"WULF 在營運效率方面展現出一定的競爭力，尤其是在其數據中心的能源使用效率和礦機維護方面。公司透過優化能源管理系統和採用高效能計算設備，努力降低營運成本。然而，比特幣挖礦行業的技術迭代迅速，持續的硬體升級和維護是必要的，這對營運效率提出了持續的挑戰。相較於行業平均水平，WULF 的營運效率尚可，但並非絕對領先。","comment_en":"WULF demonstrates a degree of competitiveness in operational efficiency, particularly in the energy usage efficiency of its data centers and mining rig maintenance. By optimizing its energy management systems and adopting high-performance computing equipment, the company strives to reduce operational costs. However, the rapid technological iteration in the Bitcoin mining industry necessitates continuous hardware upgrades and maintenance, posing ongoing challenges to operational efficiency. Compared to the industry average, WULF's operational efficiency is acceptable but not absolutely leading."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"WULF 的資本配置策略面臨挑戰。公司過去的財務表現顯示出較高的負債水平和負的股東權益報酬率，這表明其資本配置效率有待提高。雖然公司透過發行股票和債務來為擴張提供資金，但其盈利能力和現金流的穩定性仍受比特幣價格波動的影響。管理層需要在擴張、債務償還和盈利能力之間取得平衡，這對其資本配置能力提出了考驗。","comment_en":"WULF's capital allocation strategy faces challenges. The company's past financial performance indicates a high debt level and negative return on equity, suggesting that its capital allocation efficiency needs improvement. Although the company raises funds for expansion through stock and debt issuance, its profitability and cash flow stability remain susceptible to Bitcoin price volatility. Management must strike a balance between expansion, debt repayment, and profitability, which tests its capital allocation capabilities."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"WULF 的業務模式主要是為比特幣網絡提供算力，其“客戶”實際上是其自行運營的礦機。因此，傳統意義上的客戶留存概念並不適用。公司面臨的主要挑戰是維持自身的挖礦競爭力，而非留住外部客戶。由於比特幣挖礦的同質化特性，公司無法透過建立客戶忠誠度來獲得護城河。其生存和發展依賴於持續的技術投入和成本控制。","comment_en":"WULF's business model primarily involves providing hash power to the Bitcoin network; its 'customers' are essentially its self-operated mining rigs. Therefore, the traditional concept of customer retention does not apply. The main challenge the company faces is maintaining its own mining competitiveness, rather than retaining external customers. Due to the homogeneous nature of Bitcoin mining, the company cannot gain a moat by building customer loyalty. Its survival and development depend on continuous technological investment and cost control."},"m10_durability":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"比特幣挖礦行業的長期可持續性面臨不確定性。監管風險、能源成本波動、技術快速迭代以及比特幣價格的劇烈波動，都對行業的長期穩定性構成威脅。WULF 作為其中一員，其商業模式的持久性高度依賴於外部因素。雖然公司努力透過低成本能源和營運效率來維持競爭力，但其業務的本質使其難以建立像傳統行業那樣穩固的長期護城河。","comment_en":"The long-term sustainability of the Bitcoin mining industry faces uncertainty. Regulatory risks, energy cost volatility, rapid technological iteration, and the drastic fluctuations in Bitcoin prices all pose threats to the industry's long-term stability. As a participant, WULF's business model's durability is highly dependent on external factors. Although the company strives to maintain competitiveness through low-cost energy and operational efficiency, the nature of its business makes it difficult to establish a robust long-term moat comparable to traditional industries."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"TeraWulf (WULF) 在比特幣挖礦領域的經濟護城河極為薄弱。其主要優勢在於規模經濟和尋求低成本能源，這使其在成本控制方面具有一定的競爭力。然而，行業的技術同質化、缺乏品牌溢價、極低的客戶轉換成本以及網絡效應的缺失，都使得其難以建立持久的競爭壁壘。監管風險和比特幣價格波動性進一步加劇了其商業模式的不確定性。WULF 的業務更接近於一種商品型（Commodity-like）的營運，依賴於高效的執行和對市場波動的適應，而非傳統意義上的特許經營或收費橋模式。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"TeraWulf (WULF) possesses an extremely weak economic moat in the Bitcoin mining sector. Its primary advantages lie in economies of scale and the pursuit of low-cost energy, granting it some competitiveness in cost control. However, the industry's technological homogeneity, lack of brand premium, extremely low customer switching costs, and absence of network effects make it difficult to establish durable competitive barriers. Regulatory risks and Bitcoin price volatility further exacerbate the uncertainty of its business model. WULF's operations are more akin to a commodity-like business, relying on efficient execution and adaptation to market fluctuations rather than a traditional franchise or toll bridge model.","evidenceHash":"9f5bf691fafb1c8fc51c704ed4f724b87892e0dbdc9d6600a695b8a778faeaf0","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"9f5bf691fafb1c8fc51c704ed4f724b87892e0dbdc9d6600a695b8a778faeaf0","currentEvidenceHash":"9f5bf691fafb1c8fc51c704ed4f724b87892e0dbdc9d6600a695b8a778faeaf0"},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:33.922Z","evidenceHash":"df6e5306990dbdd4d1b55e848fb961b42b9c146407afbed5f63d81d92b1543ba"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T14:38:33.922Z","evidenceHash":"df6e5306990dbdd4d1b55e848fb961b42b9c146407afbed5f63d81d92b1543ba"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/WULF.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/WULF.png","website":"https://www.terawulf.com","ceo":"Paul Prager","full_time_employees":"141","description":"TeraWulf Inc., together with its subsidiaries, owns, develops, operates digital infrastructure in the United States. It also develops and operates bitcoin mining facilities for bitcoin mining and high-performance computing workloads, leveraging clean, cost-effective, and reliable energy. The company was founded in 2021 and is headquartered in Easton, Maryland.","description_en":"TeraWulf Inc., together with its subsidiaries, owns, develops, operates digital infrastructure in the United States. It also develops and operates bitcoin mining facilities for bitcoin mining and high-performance computing workloads, leveraging clean, cost-effective, and reliable energy. The company was founded in 2021 and is headquartered in Easton, Maryland.","description_zh":"TeraWulf Inc.（美股代碼：WULF）為 Financial Services 領域之重要企業，專注於 Financial - Capital Markets 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"9 Federal Street","city":"Easton","state":"MD","zip":"21601","country":"US","phone":"410 770 9500","full_address":"9 Federal Street, Easton, MD 21601, US","range_52w":"9.51-29.84","year_high":29.84,"year_low":9.51,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":9.51,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_tr